---
import AstroPipeline from "../components/AstroPipeline.astro";
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
	title="Astro CMS"
	description="EmDash is an Astro-native CMS: model content in code, render published entries in server-rendered Astro pages, and give editors a built-in admin for drafts, media, and publishing."
>
	<section class="astro-hero">
		<div class="page-shell">
			<nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
				<a href="/">EmDash</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span>Astro CMS</span>
			</nav>
			<div class="hero-grid">
				<div class="hero-copy">
					<p class="eyebrow">An Astro-native CMS</p>
					<h1>Build in Astro. Edit in EmDash.</h1>
					<p class="hero-lead">Keep your routes, components, and design in Astro. Model content in a seed file, render it on the server, and give editors a real admin in the same application.</p>
					<div class="hero-actions">
						<a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="https://docs.emdashcms.com/coming-from/astro/">Explore the Astro guide <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
						<a class="text-link" href="#how-it-works">See how it works <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
					</div>
				</div>
				<AstroPipeline />
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="proof-section" id="how-it-works" aria-labelledby="proof-heading">
		<div class="page-shell">
			<header class="section-heading">
				<p class="eyebrow">One project, two ways to work</p>
				<h2 id="proof-heading">Code stays yours. Content gets an editor.</h2>
			</header>
			<div class="proof-grid">
				<article class="proof-card proof-card--code">
					<span class="card-kicker"><span aria-hidden="true">{`{ }`}</span> For developers</span>
					<h3>Query content where you render it.</h3>
					<p>EmDash registers a live content loader for Astro. Query a collection or entry in your server-rendered page and keep its cache hint with the route.</p>
					<div class="code-shell">
						<div class="code-shell-bar"><span>src/pages/blog/[slug].astro</span><span>ASTRO</span></div>
						<pre><code><span>const</span> {`{ entry: post, cacheHint }`} =
  <span>await</span> getEmDashEntry(<em>"posts"</em>, slug);

<span>if</span> (Astro.cache?.enabled)
  Astro.cache.set(cacheHint);</code></pre>
					</div>
					<a class="card-link" href="https://docs.emdashcms.com/guides/querying-content/">Read the query guide <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
				</article>
				<article class="proof-card proof-card--editor">
					<span class="card-kicker"><span aria-hidden="true">✳</span> For editors</span>
					<h3>Work in content, not code.</h3>
					<p>Draft, revise, and publish in the built-in EmDash admin. Developers can keep shaping the Astro page while editors manage the words and media.</p>
					<figure class="editor-sketch">
						<div aria-hidden="true">
							<div class="editor-bar"><span>← &nbsp; New Post</span><span class="editor-bar-actions"><span class="editor-settings-toggle">Settings</span><span class="editor-action">Save</span></span></div>
							<div class="editor-layout">
							<div class="editor-main">
								<div class="editor-field"><span>Title</span><strong>A new chapter for the team</strong></div>
								<div class="editor-field"><span>Excerpt</span><strong>A look at what comes next.</strong></div>
								<div class="editor-field editor-field--body"><span>Content</span><div class="editor-toolbar"><b>B</b><i>I</i><span>H⌄</span><span>≡</span><span>▧</span></div><div class="editor-content">The next chapter starts with a simpler way to publish.</div></div>
							</div>
							<div class="editor-settings"><strong>Publish</strong><div class="editor-setting"><span>Slug</span><span>a-new-chapter</span></div><div class="editor-setting"><span>Content locale</span><span>EN</span></div></div>
							</div>
						</div>
						<figcaption>Illustrative EmDash editor with post fields and publishing controls.</figcaption>
					</figure>
					<a class="card-link" href="https://docs.emdashcms.com/guides/working-with-content/">Explore editing <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
				</article>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="delivery-section" aria-labelledby="delivery-heading">
		<div class="page-shell delivery-grid">
			<div class="delivery-copy">
				<p class="eyebrow">No separate SaaS backend</p>
				<h2 id="delivery-heading">Your Astro app is still the site.</h2>
				<p>EmDash adds content management to the application you own. On Cloudflare, Workers serve your Astro pages while D1 stores content and R2 stores media.</p>
				<a class="text-link" href="https://docs.emdashcms.com/coming-from/astro/">How EmDash fits Astro <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
			</div>
			<dl class="delivery-list">
				<div><dt><span aria-hidden="true">01</span> Astro</dt><dd>Your routes, layouts, and server-rendered pages.</dd></div>
				<div><dt><span aria-hidden="true">02</span> EmDash</dt><dd>Collections, drafts, revisions, and the admin editor.</dd></div>
				<div><dt><span aria-hidden="true">03</span> Cloudflare</dt><dd>Workers, D1, and R2 for this deployment path.</dd></div>
			</dl>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="astro-faq" aria-labelledby="faq-heading">
		<div class="page-shell faq-grid">
			<div><p class="eyebrow">The practical details</p><h2 id="faq-heading">Questions developers ask.</h2></div>
			<div class="faq-list">
				<details><summary>Does EmDash replace Astro routing?</summary><p>No. Astro still owns routes, layouts, components, and rendering. EmDash provides live content and the editing application alongside them.</p></details>
				<details><summary>Do editors need to change code?</summary><p>No. Developers define the content model and page design; editors create drafts, update content, and publish through the EmDash admin.</p></details>
				<details><summary>Can I begin without a Cloudflare account?</summary><p>Yes. The Node.js starter uses SQLite and local media storage for a complete local preview. This marketing site uses the Cloudflare D1 and R2 deployment path.</p></details>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="astro-cta"><div class="page-shell"><div><p class="eyebrow">Start in your project</p><h2>Give your Astro site an editor.</h2></div><a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="https://docs.emdashcms.com/getting-started/">Start building <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
</Base>

<style>
	.page-shell { width: min(calc(100% - 3rem), var(--wide-width)); margin-inline: auto; }
	.eyebrow { color: var(--color-primary); font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 650; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase; }
	h1, h2, h3 { font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.05em; text-wrap: balance; }
	h2 { font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 4.7vw, 4.7rem); line-height: 1.07; }
	.astro-hero { padding: 8.5rem 0 clamp(5rem, 8vw, 8rem); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-bg) 68%, var(--color-surface)); }
	.breadcrumbs { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.8rem; color: var(--color-muted); font-size: 0.78rem; }
	.breadcrumbs a { color: inherit; }
	.breadcrumbs a:hover { color: var(--color-primary); }
	.hero-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.85fr) minmax(0, 1.15fr); align-items: center; gap: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 5rem); margin-top: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 5rem); }
	.hero-copy { min-width: 0; }
	h1 { max-width: 35rem; margin-top: 1.2rem; font-size: clamp(3.1rem, 5vw, 5.2rem); line-height: 1.02; }
	.hero-lead { max-width: 34rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; color: var(--color-muted); font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.3vw, 1.2rem); line-height: 1.65; }
	.hero-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1.6rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
	.hero-actions .btn, .astro-cta .btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.65rem; }
	.text-link, .card-link { display: inline-flex; width: fit-content; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; color: var(--color-text); font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; }
	.text-link:hover, .card-link:hover { color: var(--color-primary); }
	.text-link:focus-visible, .card-link:focus-visible, .breadcrumbs a:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--color-primary); outline-offset: 5px; border-radius: 2px; }
	.proof-section, .astro-faq { padding: clamp(5rem, 9vw, 9rem) 0; }
	#how-it-works { scroll-margin-top: 6rem; }
	.section-heading { max-width: 55rem; margin-bottom: 3rem; }
	.section-heading h2 { margin-top: 1rem; }
	.proof-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.1fr) minmax(0, 0.9fr); gap: 1rem; }
	.proof-card { display: flex; min-width: 0; min-height: 34rem; flex-direction: column; padding: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.5rem); background: var(--color-surface); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); }
	.proof-card--editor { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-bg) 60%, var(--color-surface)); }
	.card-kicker { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.55rem; color: var(--color-primary); font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, monospace; font-size: 0.68rem; font-weight: 600; }
	.card-kicker span { display: grid; width: 1.7rem; height: 1.7rem; place-items: center; background: var(--heat-8); border-radius: 0.4rem; font-size: 0.9rem; }
	.proof-card h3 { max-width: 23rem; margin: 1.5rem 0 0.7rem; font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3vw, 2.6rem); line-height: 1.12; }
	.proof-card > p { max-width: 31rem; color: var(--color-muted); font-size: 0.94rem; line-height: 1.65; }
	.code-shell, .editor-sketch { width: 100%; min-width: 0; margin: auto 0 1.6rem; overflow: hidden; background: var(--color-bg); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: 0.7rem; }
	.code-shell-bar, .editor-bar { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 0.8rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border); font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 600; }
	.code-shell-bar span:last-child { color: var(--color-muted); font-size: 0.57rem; }
	.code-shell pre { overflow-x: auto; padding: 1.3rem 1rem; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, monospace; font-size: clamp(0.69rem, 1vw, 0.8rem); line-height: 1.75; }
	.code-shell code { font: inherit; }
	.code-shell code span, .code-shell code em { color: var(--color-primary); font-style: normal; }
	.editor-sketch { padding-bottom: 0.25rem; }
	.editor-sketch figcaption { padding: 0.6rem 1rem; color: var(--color-muted); font-size: 0.62rem; line-height: 1.4; }
	.editor-bar-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.35rem; }
	.editor-bar .editor-action { padding: 0.35rem 0.8rem; color: #fff; background: #2755d8; border-radius: 0.3rem; font-size: 0.65rem; }
	.editor-settings-toggle { display: none; padding: 0.35rem 0.5rem; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: 0.3rem; font-size: 0.62rem; }
	.editor-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 7.5rem; }
	.editor-main { min-width: 0; padding: 0.8rem; }
	.editor-field { display: flex; min-width: 0; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.3rem; margin-bottom: 0.7rem; font-size: 0.64rem; font-weight: 600; }
	.editor-field strong { display: block; overflow: hidden; padding: 0.55rem 0.6rem; background: var(--color-surface); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: 0.3rem; font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 500; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
	.editor-field--body { margin-bottom: 0; }
	.editor-toolbar { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.7rem; padding: 0.4rem 0.6rem; background: var(--color-surface); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-bottom: 0; border-radius: 0.3rem 0.3rem 0 0; font-size: 0.64rem; font-weight: 500; }
	.editor-content { min-height: 4.2rem; padding: 0.55rem 0.6rem; background: var(--color-surface); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: 0 0 0.3rem 0.3rem; font-size: 0.65rem; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.5; }
	.editor-settings { min-width: 0; padding: 0.85rem 0.65rem; background: var(--color-surface); border-left: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
	.editor-settings > strong { font-size: 0.68rem; }
	.editor-setting { display: flex; min-width: 0; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.3rem; margin-top: 0.9rem; color: var(--color-muted); font-size: 0.57rem; }
	.editor-setting span:last-child { overflow: hidden; padding: 0.4rem; color: var(--color-text); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: 0.3rem; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
	.delivery-section { padding: clamp(5rem, 9vw, 9rem) 0; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-bg) 55%, var(--color-surface)); border-block: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
	.delivery-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.9fr) minmax(0, 1.1fr); gap: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 8rem); }
	.delivery-copy h2 { max-width: 33rem; margin: 1rem 0; }
	.delivery-copy > p:not(.eyebrow) { max-width: 32rem; color: var(--color-muted); font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.65; }
	.delivery-copy .text-link { margin-top: 2rem; }
	.delivery-list > div { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.65fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 1rem; padding: 1.5rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
	.delivery-list > div:first-child { border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
	.delivery-list dt { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 0.8rem; font-size: 1.13rem; font-weight: 600; }
	.delivery-list dt span { color: var(--color-primary); font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, monospace; font-size: 0.66rem; }
	.delivery-list dd { color: var(--color-muted); font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.6; }
	.faq-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.75fr) minmax(0, 1.25fr); gap: clamp(2rem, 7vw, 7rem); }
	.faq-grid h2 { max-width: 23rem; margin-top: 1rem; }
	.faq-list details { padding: 1.5rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
	.faq-list details:first-child { border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
	.faq-list summary { cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; list-style: none; }
	.faq-list summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
	.faq-list summary::after { float: right; margin-inline-start: 1rem; color: var(--color-primary); content: "+"; }
	.faq-list details[open] summary::after { content: "−"; }
	.faq-list summary:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--color-primary); outline-offset: 5px; }
	.faq-list details p { max-width: 37rem; padding-top: 1rem; color: var(--color-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.65; }
	.astro-cta { padding: 4rem 0; background: var(--color-text); color: var(--color-bg); }
	.astro-cta .page-shell { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 2rem; }
	.astro-cta h2 { max-width: 42rem; margin-top: 0.8rem; font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 3.5rem); }
	.astro-cta .btn { flex: none; }
	@media (max-width: 950px) {
		.hero-grid, .proof-grid, .delivery-grid, .faq-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
		.hero-copy { max-width: 42rem; }
	}
	@media (max-width: 600px) {
		.page-shell { width: min(calc(100% - 2rem), var(--wide-width)); }
		.astro-hero { padding-top: 7rem; }
		.proof-card { min-height: 31rem; }
		.editor-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
		.editor-settings { display: none; }
		.editor-settings-toggle { display: inline-flex; }
		.delivery-list > div { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 0.4rem; }
		.astro-cta .page-shell { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; }
	}
	@media (max-width: 380px) {
		.code-shell pre { white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
	}
</style>
